{title: Hum Tere Sheher Me Aaye Hain}
{artist: Ghulam Ali}
{key: D#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[D#m]Hum Tere Shahar [G#]Mein Aaye hain
[A#]Musaafir [D#m]Ki Tarah
[D#]Sirf [F#]Ek Baar
[G#]Mulaaqaat [D#]Ka Mauqa [D#m]De De
[D#m]Meri Manzil hai kahan
[G#]mera Thikana [D#m]hai kahan
[D#m]Subah tak tujh se bichhad kar
[G#]mujhe jaana [D#m]hai kahan
[D#]Sochne ke liye [G#]ik raat ka
[D#]mauka [D#m]dede
[D#m]Apni Ankhon Mein Chhupa
[G#]Rakhein Hain [D#m]Jugnu Maine
[D#m]Apni Palkon Pe Saja
[G#]Rakhe hai [D#m]Aansu Maine
[D#]Meri Ankhon Ko Bhi
[G#]Barsaat [D#]Ka Mauqa [D#m]De De
[D#m]Aaj ki raat mera
[G#]dard-e-mohobbat [D#m]sun le
[D#m]Kapkapate hue honthon ki
[G#]shikayat [D#m]sun le
[D#]Aaj [G#]izhaar-e-khayalat
[D#]ka mauka [D#m]de de
